# Sanitization key (artifacts/run-1) — NEVER commit.
# Lets a recipient restore the real identifiers behind the placeholders
# in artifacts/run-1/.  Keep this file outside any git repo.  When a
# partner needs it, hand it over through an encrypted channel (password-
# protected archive via out-of-band transport, or a secrets manager).
# Rotation: regenerate via desanitize-key.json builder; old key then
# stops working for new artifacts.
desanitize.key.json
